Creates a gravity spike in a radius of [2, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] that moves all targets towards the spell's center and inflicts [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical (gravity) damage.

Each target moved beyond the first increases the damage by [17, 24, 28, 32, 36 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] (up to a maximum of [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] bonus damage).

Targets take reduced damage the further they are from the epicenter (20% less per tile).

The damage dealt will scale with your Spellpower.
